  "word_count": 109,
  "text_content": "One day, Sade helped Mama cook rice for the family. First, Mama washed the rice in a big bowl. Sade cut the tomatoes and the onions. Then Mama put a pot on the fire. She put in some oil, and Sade added the onions. The kitchen was warm and sweet. Sade stirred the pot with a long spoon. Mama added the tomatoes and a little pepper. Soon the rice began to steam. Sade wanted to taste it right away. Mama said, wait a little more. After ten minutes, the rice was ready. The whole family sat at the table. Sade smiled and said it was the best rice ever.",
